 le Kidman\, Practical Magic 2 returns to a world steeped in moonlit mischi
 ef and powerful ancestral magic\, as the Owens sisters must confront the d
 ark curse that threatens to unravel their family once and for all in a mus
 t-see cinematic event of fun\, magic and mayhem.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/c
 inema/in-theaters/practical-magic-2\n\nEstimated start: 16:05
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
